{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"写的是他不愿减少喜欢、也不愿因怕受伤而收回心意的内在态度，没有新增前史、外部事件或具体场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"回想的是前面各段已经建立的安心靠近、真心付出和独自思念时的快乐，没有增添具体往事，也没有把珠子的比喻写成真实场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"顺着亲近的念头和生出玩心都是心理状态，没有把珠子里的轻快调情、摇荡或催促写成真实互动，也没有用音乐变化解释心理。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-4\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"保留了没有保证却仍盼回应的矛盾，并说明一时的欢喜如何压过落空的顾虑，没有新增事件或对白。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-5\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"把快乐尚未结束便开始怀念的变化写成对眼前亲近转瞬即逝的隐忧，且有前段依据，没有新增具体场景或往事。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S07-5说他记得真心关心对方时的快乐、舍不得少关心一点，直接支撑他不愿减少喜欢，也能承接他不愿再收回心意的态度。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-1明确交代安心靠近和真心付出为何能带来满足，也说明这种满足不必依赖对方回应，直接支撑这次回想。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S04-3说明他在不计较付出时曾松一口气、更愿意付出，能够支撑他回想真心对人好时的快乐。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S06-3直接说明想到对方时心里发甜、暂时顾不上回应问题，正是独自想着对方也能快乐的前因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-4\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S07-4已经说明他仍盼着回应、也知道眼前亲近留不住，能解释S08-4中仍然存在、只是暂时被欢喜盖过的顾虑。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-5\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-2早已说明他想让亲近持续、却知道日子仍在向前，这为他刚肯放开喜欢便担心亲近消逝提供了前因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-5\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S07-4已经明确说眼前亲近的时刻留不住，直接支撑他对这种亲近转眼过去的隐忧。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只读线也能看出完整变化：他不再因害怕而收回喜欢，重新承认过去的快乐，暂时让欢喜压过顾虑，随后又隐约担心眼前的亲近留不住。\",\n  \"lost\": [],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "37d48a3f-6c49-43ce-b8f8-b2b9f294b070", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T085757144450Z", "elapsed_seconds": 494.454, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T09:06:11.609147+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3d4a48e6ccfbf036424429ebf94db2042da0f677726cf22ea22155660edfbe5e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T085757144450Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "a763cb5e2e8ee8e48d5cbd8a1acfdcf